3.2  VISIBLE ACKNOWLEDGMENT. Licensees must visibly acknowledge the
     Indigenous authorship and tribal affiliation, including:
     (a)  attribution on all user-facing interfaces where the Work is used;
     (b)  acknowledgment in technical documentation, including API and model
